<title>USA: Justice Dept probing Maxicare Health unit.</title>
<headline>Justice Dept probing Maxicare Health unit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxicare Health Plans Inc said its Maxicare Health Plans of the Midwest subsidiary received a demand from the U.S. Department of Justice to consider whether or not the company violated antitrust laws in Illinois.</p>
<p>Maxicare said it plans to fully cooperate with the investigation.</p>
</text>
